#. module: account_followup
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account_followup
msgid ""
"\n"
"Module to automate letters for unpaid invoices, with multi-level recalls.\n"
"=========================================================================\n"
"\n"
"You can define your multiple levels of recall through the invoicing "
"settings:\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"    Configuration / Settings / Customer Invoices / Automatic Invoice "
"Reminders\n"
"\n"
"Features:\n"
"---------\n"
"    - Automatic multi-level reminders based on overdue duration.\n"
"    - Send & Print integration:\n"
"        If Send & Print is executed again on an overdue invoice, the system\n"
"        automatically switches to the appropriate reminder template and "
"attaches\n"
"        the follow-up report.\n"
"    - Batch reminders:\n"
"        Users can select multiple invoices from the list view and send "
"reminders\n"
"        to multiple customers at once using the 'Send Reminders' action.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Módulo para automatizar tus mensajes de facturas sin pagar, con diferentes "
"niveles de recordatorios.\n"
"=========================================================================\n"
"\n"
"Puedes definir varios niveles de recordatorio con los ajustes de "
"facturación:\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"    Configuración / Ajustes / Facturas de los clientes / Recordatorios "
"automáticos de facturas\n"
"\n"
"Funciones:\n"
"---------\n"
"    - Recordatorios automáticos de varios niveles según la duración del "
"retraso.\n"
"    - Integración con Enviar e imprimir:\n"
"        Si se ejecuta Enviar e imprimir otra vez en una factura pendiente, "
"el sistema\n"
"        cambia automáticamente a la plantilla de recordatorio apropiada y "
"adjunta\n"
"        el reporte de seguimiento.\n"
"    - Recordatorios en lote:\n"
"       Los usuarios pueden seleccionar varias facturas de la vista de lista "
"y enviar recordatorios\n"
"        a varios clientes al mismo tiempo usando la acción 'Enviar "
"recordatorios'.\n"

